      "factual_description": "The Hamilton Live lists Cyril Neville Plays the Dead for Saturday, September 19, 2026 at 8:00 PM in Washington, DC. The authorized EVENTIM listing confirms 6:30 PM doors, an 8:00 PM show and active ticket sales. Neville is a vocalist and percussionist from the Neville Brothers/Meters lineage; the same named project appears on a multi-city September 2026 run, including Brooklyn, Charlottesville, Charlotte, Jackson and New Orleans. Apple Music lists his current album Don't Wait Til I'm Gone, released May 29, 2026.",
