      "provenance": {
        "status": "verified-authoritative-sources",
        "note": "Date/time/venue were verified from The Hamilton and authorized EVENTIM ticketing. The multi-city nature of the project was independently visible in current artist/ticketing listings and is used only to calibrate scarcity. The repository was searched for Cyril Neville Plays the Dead before publication and no existing event or batch was found. No unannounced sidemen were inferred."
