      "factual_description": "Billboard Live Tokyo presents ZARUKAME on Thursday, November 5, 2026, with sets at 5:30 PM and 8:30 PM. The violin/cello duo of Yuri Kamei and Sonoko Muraoka expands to a five-piece band with Akinori Handa on piano, Tetsuro Toyama on guitar and Akira Kudo on drums. Billboard identifies this as ZARUKAME's first Billboard Live appearance and describes the project as pursuing an instrumental language that combines classical/academic string textures with pop accessibility. The duo has released new material in 2026, including NEW WORLD and Konomichinosakini.",
