      "factual_description": "Billboard Live Tokyo presents Ohashi Trio's TRIO Sextet Billboard Live Tour 2026 on Friday, November 6, 2026, with sets at 6:00 PM and 9:00 PM. The six-piece lineup is Ohashi Trio, Takumadrops, Daisuke Abe, Marty Holoubek, Naoki Takahashi and Takayuki Sato. Billboard and Ohashi Trio's official site describe the run as a jazz-based sextet treatment distinct from his 2026 hall tour, with dates in Tokyo, Yokohama and Osaka. Ohashi Trio released A BAND on March 18, 2026; his official discography describes it as a rock-centered album that folds in bossa nova and funk elements.",
